Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:12.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:16.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:18.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where the hell have you been these past few days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:19.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.22,0:00:22.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.94,0:00:25.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should've known you two were behind this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could you hide someone else's child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:30.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got me needlessly concerned!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.97,0:00:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll sue you for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:38.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you look for Kayo at all\Nover the past three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:39.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you making me out to be the bad guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:48.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:00:59.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo?! Let go of me, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Needlessly concerned"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.89,0:01:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only thing you're concerned about is yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:05.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing,\NKayo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:49.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!\NWhy aren't you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enough, Hinazuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo-chan doesn't want to see you like this either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:58.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking! You're treating me\Nlike a villain in front of my own daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:03:01.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And after you kidnapped her, too!\NWho do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:07.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You deserve it for locking her in a shed and \Nnot caring when she goes missing for three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:11.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've no idea about the pains\Nand responsibilities of parenting,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so don't run your mouth, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:17.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are Hinazuki Akemi-san, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:22.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are from Ishikari City Hall's\NChild Welfare Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:29.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've come to talk to you\Nabout your daughter, Kayo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You set me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:35.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn the both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:39.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We thought we couldn't get you\Nto meet us by ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:42.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so we asked Fujinuma-san for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:46.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who said I wouldn't meet you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:47.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:52.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry we asked you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be, Yashiro-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:04:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give her a piece of my mind,\Nso I'm actually glad to be of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who kidnapped my daughter!\NHurry up and call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:10.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we first need to discuss your usual\Nrelationship with your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you even talking about?\NWhat's wrong with how I treat Kayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:19.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've decided that your daughter, Kayo-chan,\Nneeds to be taken into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:21.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Custody?! I'm her legal {custodian}guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you didn't even try to look for her\Nwhen she went missing for three days.\NThat's child negligence!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:28.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it was all that brat's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:31.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why am I being treated like a criminal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Hinazuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:34.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.66,0:04:35.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:37.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the police myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can settle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come, Kayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:45.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:50.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on! Quit dragging your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:53.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akemi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:00.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akemi, my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:09.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:15.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been estranged ever since\NI made you split up with that man,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I've been worried about you two the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:28.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know better than anyone how hard\Nit is for a single mother to raise a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:33.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must've been so lonely.\NIt must've been so hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should've helped you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I made you...\Nshoulder it all yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:12.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, this is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't think badly of Akemi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:37.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those tears were probably born out of self-pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It seemed like Kayo was\Navoiding looking at her mother
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:46.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}because she wasn't someone\Nshe could cling to and cry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.62,0:06:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akemi, my girl. Don't worry about Kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.13,0:06:54.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I promise to take good care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:07:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My child is the most important thing\Nin my life. He means the world to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you must've felt the same at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:15.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need. You're the one\Nwho got us into gear, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way we could let your\Ncourageous efforts end in tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:23.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo will be all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hardly have any memories of my father...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:32.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if this is how a father's words sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For getting me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.64,0:07:48.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall we go, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:56.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The Town With Only Me Erased," by Hinazuki Kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:08:02.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I grow older, old enough \Nto go wherever I want by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:04.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to a faraway country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to a faraway island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to an island with nobody around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:14.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to an island\Nwith no sorrow or suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On that island, I'll climb a tree when I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}swim in the ocean when I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and sleep when I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:41.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I think about the town from which\NI've been erased, I feel lighthearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:03.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I finally managed to save Kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:06.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I made sure her life would last far into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:11.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From here on, Kayo will walk down her own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:17.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I believe that a bright future lies ahead of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:27.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru's been like this all day. Is he gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:31.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a hero for saving Hinazuki,\Nbut look at him now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru-kun. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:37.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:39.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't look fine at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:43.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can ya blame him? Hinazuki's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. All's well that ends well, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:47.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.78,0:09:49.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come with me for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:55.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think Kayo's mother will have to\Nstay away from her for a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means Kayo's going to start\Na new life with her grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.64,0:10:02.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no need for—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:06.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said you couldn't let my\Ncourageous efforts end in tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.07,0:10:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those words mean a lot to me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:22.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it might be crude to call \Nthat ending a sort of compensation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'd still say your actions merited a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:30.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you want to see Kayo smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:37.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like I get my reward as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Satoru,\Nwas Kayo at your place the entire time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:44.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, at a hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:45.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A hideout?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:50.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We hid Kayo in a bus the Izumi Elementary\Nice hockey team wasn't using anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:55.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So only kidnappers like you would go there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:56.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:10:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that's a joke, it ain't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.68,0:11:05.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that Kayo's gone, the killer's targets\Nare down to Hiromi and Nakanishi Aya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:09.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now, I have to make sure\Nneither of them are left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:14.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just like with Kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:19.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hiromi's one thing, since he's my classmate,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:24.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but Nakanishi Aya goes to Izumi Elementary\Nnext door, so it'll be hard to approach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently she's often with Yuuki-san,\Nbut how am I supposed to talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She {had}has no clue who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:34.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is going to be pretty difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:39.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How to become friends\Nwith someone you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:43.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just go up and ask them to be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As if that'd work—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're thinking, "As if that'd work," aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:49.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:52.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've already got Kayo-chan,\Nbut your eyes are wandering, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:54.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:56.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was just a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:59.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, okay, it is a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:01.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's always by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't get anywhere with that attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:07.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Focus on a positive outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:09.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As they say, nothing ventured, nothing gained.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:15.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need to stop by somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:17.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are going to the kids' center, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:18.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll meet you there, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:21.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:22.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:37.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So she gets out of cram school at 6:30 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.71,0:12:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can walk Hiromi home\Nand still get back here in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:45.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First I need to figure out what they do every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:12:59.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nakanishi Aya's daily routine was simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:02.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she were to be kidnapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.29,0:13:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it'd most likely happen at this time,\Nright after she's let out of cram school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:07.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:10.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am I ever glad to see you! Give me a hand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:15.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You just {\i0}had{\i1} to show up when I wanted\Nto follow her and see where she lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:17.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you buy so much stuff at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:18.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What could I do? It was on sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:20.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say it out loud. It'll only make it feel heavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.73,0:13:25.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'd be heavy even if I kept my mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:30.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:33.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom went overboard shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:34.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:42.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:45.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you married?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.77,0:13:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:50.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:53.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can only\Nget married if you have a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:56.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then they need to be ready for it,\Nand the time's got to be right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:57.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, maybe I'm being too cautious because\Nof a painful experience I've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:05.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.\NI didn't mind answering that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was actually gonna ask you a different question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:20.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How to approach a girl you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:23.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I know her, but she doesn't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.12,0:14:27.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm the cautious type,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I'd start by making her less wary of me,\Neven if it meant beating around the bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:32.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make her less wary?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:36.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, show off your good side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like, if you're good at sports\Nor cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:40.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use whatever you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:44.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The moment she takes an interest in it,\Nshe'll let her guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:47.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be too impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:52.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not good at expressing my \Nfeelings {in a direct manner}directly, so I just rely on logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:57.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something's sticking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that, Satoru!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:02.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorr—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You caught me, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:12.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:15.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you've seen it,\Nno point in hiding it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:18.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You eat some too! Become my accomplice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:25.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ever since I quit smoking three years ago,\Ncandy has been my go-to substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:29.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I'm by myself, I can't relax without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:31.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-What a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:33.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:41.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gimme one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:43.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go do my homework at the kids' center.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hiromi. I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:57.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First Hinazuki, and now it's like\Nyou're Hiromi's guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:58.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we talk in private, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:04.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:08.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hiromi. I'll join you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.81,0:16:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:13.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's really on your mind, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:17.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw how determined you were\Nto save Hinazuki at all costs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.13,0:16:22.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but everything went well,\Nso what's wrong with you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If something's bothering you,\Ncould you tell me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:31.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't really explain it. It's too far-fetched.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna dig deep and take a step forward like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:39.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna become a superhero, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's another part to this, take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you make of these footprints, Kenya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An adult's been through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not just that. Take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think they had their shoes wrapped in cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.43,0:17:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't to prevent them from slipping, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:05.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probably to avoid leaving distinctive footprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.94,0:17:16.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The backpack's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.89,0:17:18.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So's the box with the briquettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:21.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think there are fewer boxes in general.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A lot of torn up cartons, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody must've taken the contents with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:30.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your point, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.91,0:17:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the man who supposedly\Nshowed up late at night when Kayo was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The guy who left a backpack\Nfull of sketchy stuff here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.15,0:17:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure he's a murderer\Nwho's targeting children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:49.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that this sounds unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:18:00.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't give you a proper explanation right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:02.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I saw the backpack and the briquettes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.84,0:18:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought that this was a hiding place\Nfor a serial killer's murdering tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.15,0:18:11.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even I know that it sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you now since it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:19.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The whole Kayo thing? Preventing\Nher mother's abuse was only part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:24.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to protect her from this murderer.\NThat's why I didn't want to leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:33.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you aspire to become a detective\Nor a novelist when you grow up, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:37.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The issue isn't whether what\Nyou're saying is too far-fetched or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:40.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's whether I believe you or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.41,0:18:48.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to walk me this close to home.\NI'll be fine. I'm a boy, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:50.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I had something to do here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.19,0:18:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:03.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to believe you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:06.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can,\Nso tell me if you ever need help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:09.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:10.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:12.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.18,0:19:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Satoru, 99 percent of me\N thinks your theory couldn't possibly be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the other one percent thinks\Nit's not completely out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.85,0:19:31.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.74,0:19:35.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the outside, it probably looks like\NI'm playing detective, making up crimes—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.01,0:19:36.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Playing detective is fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:40.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might be because of\Nwhat's been happening lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.05,0:19:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I think that we should let your feelings guide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:51.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You believed in me and\Ngave me your side of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:54.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I want to do my part and believe in you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's for my own sake that I want to trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Similar to someone wanting to be trusted,\Nbut the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:05.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kenya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:07.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hiromi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:12.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could've saved her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:17.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}18 years ago, I think I said\Nthose words to my mother and cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never want to go through that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't leave anybody alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.61,0:20:27.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.68,0:20:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember to get your parents\Nto fill out that handout!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.77,0:20:38.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:42.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to come with me somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru, wanna hit up the hideout now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we've got something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.36,0:20:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you later, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:20:54.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.34,0:20:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:20:59.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're they sneaking around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wanna follow them, then?\NSure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:03.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
